#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is busy or its usage limit has been reached. Please try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s est occupé ou sa limite d'utilisation est atteinte. Réessayez dans "
"un instant."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is having trouble on its side right now. Please try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s rencontre un problème de son côté pour le moment. Réessayez dans un"
" instant."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is not set up to read images. Tick \"Can read images (OCR / "
"vision)\" on that model if it supports vision, or pick another one to read "
"documents under Settings → DIGI-ERP AI."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s n'est pas configuré pour lire les images. Cochez « Peut lire les "
"images (OCR / vision) » sur ce modèle s'il gère la vision, ou choisissez-en "
"un autre pour lire les documents dans Paramètres → DIGI-ERP AI."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is set to a provider DIGI-ERP AI does not know (%(kind)s). An "
"administrator can correct it under DIGI-ERP AI → AI Models."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s est associé à un fournisseur inconnu de DIGI-ERP AI (%(kind)s). Un "
"administrateur peut le corriger dans DIGI-ERP AI → Modèles d'IA."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s refused the connection: its API key is missing, wrong or expired. "
"An administrator can fix it under DIGI-ERP AI → AI Models."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s a refusé la connexion : sa clé API est absente, incorrecte ou "
"expirée. Un administrateur peut la corriger dans DIGI-ERP AI → Modèles d'IA."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s rejected the request: the account has no credit left, or the "
"message is too large. An administrator can check the account."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s a rejeté la requête : le compte n'a plus de crédit, ou le message "
"est trop volumineux. Un administrateur peut vérifier le compte."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid "%(name)s returned an empty answer. Please try asking again."
msgstr "%(name)s a renvoyé une réponse vide. Réessayez de poser la question."

#. module: digi_erp_ai_solution
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/digi_erp_ai_solution/services/llm_providers.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s took too long to answer. Try a shorter question, or raise the "
"answer timeout under Settings → DIGI-ERP AI."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s a mis trop de temps à répondre. Posez une question plus courte, ou "
"augmentez le délai de réponse dans Paramètres → DIGI-ERP AI."

